    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51427" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰφῐ-γένειᾰ</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑφ], ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strong-born, mighty</i>, epith. of Artemis, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				2.35.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pr. n.,
			<u>Iphigeneia</u>, Agamemnon's daughter, the Homeric
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰφιάνασσα</span> (but distd. by
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
