				1023
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἶφις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					324
				</span></i>
			. [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-είᾱ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1526
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).]</div>
